000010EA                           149  * Subroutine    : Game
000010EA                           150  * Description   : Game including main GameLoop. GameLoop is like
000010EA                           151  * a while loop in that it runs forever until interupted
000010EA                           152  * (Input, Update, Draw). The Enemies Run at Player Jump to Avoid
000010EA                           153  *-----------------------------------------------------------
000010EA                           154  GAME:
000010EA  6100 0296                155      BSR     PLAY_RUN                ; Play Run Wav
000010EE                           156  GAMELOOP:
000010EE                           157      ; Main Gameloop
000010EE  6100 0014                158      BSR     INPUT                   ; Check Keyboard Input
000010F2  6100 0056                159      BSR     UPDATE                  ; Update positions and points
000010F6  6100 01EE                160      BSR     IS_PLAYER_ON_GND        ; Check if player is on ground
000010FA  6100 0370                161      BSR     CHECK_COLLISIONS        ; Check for Collisions
000010FE  6100 0168                162      BSR     DRAW                    ; Draw the Scene
00001102  60EA                     163      BRA     GAMELOOP                ; Loop back to GameLoop
